From: mscharged-port
Subject: Run ImGui without SDL on the Switch
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4
Classification: Nintendo Switch host (Switch only). Apply after 0119.

ImGui's SDL3 backends need more of SDL3 than sdl3on2 offers. As in new-coke's
Strikers port, the overlay draws through WebGPU alone and takes no pointer or
key input there; the frame time comes from the steady clock.

